Z||000000||wkayl||07-13-2001||07:00 PM||||I sent an e-mail to Anthony.  Here is the response I recieved....<P>Hi, it was good hearing from you.<P>Sorry about not writing to you for awhile, I'm actually back up at CSU right now and have been taking a couple of courses this summer which has kept me really busy.  <P>I'm still overwhelmed by the enormous generosity and kindness everyone has shown me.  And I'm really surprised to hear that you have a check for me, I guess I assumed it was sent to the fund that was setup for me. I would really like to meet up with you sometime.  Just let me know when works for you, I am going to California on Thurs. to visit my family for a couple of weeks, but other than that I'm pretty free.  Thanks again and i hope to hear from you soon.<P>Anthony Barber<P>I plan on getting together with him sometime in August to close out the fund account. <P>For those not familiar with this topic go to:<P> <A HREF="http://www.fieroforum.com/barber/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroforum.com/barber/</A>  <P>Do not feel any pressure to contribute to this.  It is just an FYI to new forum members.  Feel free to direct any comments to me via the forum.<P>Wayne  <P><BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_2.jpg"> <BR>Dnyee's 88 Formula, Casey's 86GT, Wayne's 86GT.  <BR>We consider my wife as being "Fiero Challenged"||||reg||14
Z||000001||BAM-BAM||07-13-2001||08:37 PM||||  Thanks Wayne, I have been wondering about this for a while. Didn't want to stir up the Forum again. It sounds like he is recovered/ing well and is in good spirits. I tried to E-Mail you a couple of times but got no response, but this is just fine. E-Mail me, I have some questions that I would like to ask,  but this  isn't the place. Thanks again for the update!<P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||12
